<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - Philips H1 segment revenues/income.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Philips H1 segment revenues/income.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips revenues</p>
<p>and income from operations by product segment first half of 1997</p>
<p>in millions of guilders:</p>
<p>REVENUES -----</p>
<p>    Lighting				     4,795  vs  4,296</p>
<p>    Consumer products			 10,625  vs 11,317</p>
<p>    Components and semiconductors	  8,881  vs  7,772</p>
<p>    Professional products/systems	  5,859  vs  5,266</p>
<p>    Software and services		    5,907  vs  5,616</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous				1,778  vs  1,999</p>
<p>    Intersegment sales		 debit 4,459  vs  4,467 debit</p>
<p>    Total sales				 33,386  vs 31,799</p>
<p>INCOME FROM OPERATIONS -----</p>
<p>    Lighting					 580  vs    487</p>
<p>    Consumer products		   profit 268  vs     92 loss</p>
<p>    Components/semiconductors		1,059  vs    908</p>
<p>    Professional products/systems   profit  95  vs     81 loss</p>
<p>    Software and services			420  vs    340</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous				   89  vs    141</p>
<p>    Unallocated costs/revenues	 debit 521  vs    460 debit</p>
<p>    Total income from operations	    1,990 vs  1,243</p>
<p>    Income from ops as pct of sales	  6.0  vs    3.9</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
